{%- comment -%}
  The privacy policy link after the sign-up forms' fine print. shop.privacy_policy.url carries the
  language's code (/zh-CN/policies/…), which isn't the shop's path for that language (/zh), so it was
  a dead link in Chinese (found by tools/site-check, 2026-11-03). Built on the language's own root instead.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign handle = shop.privacy_policy.url | split: '/' | last -%}
<a class="spec-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/policies/' | append: handle | replace: '//', '/' }}">{{ 'general.privacy' | t }}</a>
